            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394270/extras/8f5cdbfa3eec4fdb48af17f04e715de3.avif?t=1765965722\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Wild West with Country Tales — a heartwarming time-management strategy game. Help Ted, Catherine, and friends rebuild Sunset Hills, explore charming frontier towns, gather resources, trade, complete quests, and thwart a corrupt mayor’s ambitious plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394270/extras/de4648a363ead779b2b40fc6e5051d8d.avif?t=1765965722\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Dozens of levels packed with city building fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Build, upgrade, and defend your towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Use powerful boosts &amp; unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Intriguing narrative — a plot with twists and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to gather resources, build houses, manage workers, and keep your people thriving as you progress through each level. Use boosts when things get tough — but the real reward is mastering strategy and efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand, optimize, upgrade, and develop your settlements the way you like. Customizable challenge — Relaxed, Standard, and Extreme difficulty modes. Earn Achievements as you complete objectives and perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Immersive adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mix of colorful art, atmosphere, and story-rich progression paired with satisfying time-management and city-building mechanics. Whether you enjoy calm, casual resource gathering or intense strategic challenges — this game delivers both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394270/extras/7609f94915f03c101a455c03f43abcb4.avif?t=1765965722\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HELP Ted &amp; Catherine and friends in their adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EXPLORE the Wild West in this fun and addictive time management game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MEET peculiar character and follow the exciting story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will Ted and Catherine fall IN LOVE?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PUT the bad guys where they belong - behind bars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 40 EXCITING levels to master and HUNDREDS of quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: relaxed, timed and extreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND hidden treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > WIN achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > GORGEOUS high definition visuals and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step-by-step tutorials for beginners</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394270/extras/8f5cdbfa3eec4fdb48af17f04e715de3.avif?t=1765965722\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Wild West with Country Tales — a heartwarming time-management strategy game. Help Ted, Catherine, and friends rebuild Sunset Hills, explore charming frontier towns, gather resources, trade, complete quests, and thwart a corrupt mayor’s ambitious plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394270/extras/de4648a363ead779b2b40fc6e5051d8d.avif?t=1765965722\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Dozens of levels packed with city building fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Build, upgrade, and defend your towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Use powerful boosts &amp; unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Intriguing narrative — a plot with twists and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to gather resources, build houses, manage workers, and keep your people thriving as you progress through each level. Use boosts when things get tough — but the real reward is mastering strategy and efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand, optimize, upgrade, and develop your settlements the way you like. Customizable challenge — Relaxed, Standard, and Extreme difficulty modes. Earn Achievements as you complete objectives and perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Immersive adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mix of colorful art, atmosphere, and story-rich progression paired with satisfying time-management and city-building mechanics. Whether you enjoy calm, casual resource gathering or intense strategic challenges — this game delivers both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394270/extras/7609f94915f03c101a455c03f43abcb4.avif?t=1765965722\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HELP Ted &amp; Catherine and friends in their adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EXPLORE the Wild West in this fun and addictive time management game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MEET peculiar character and follow the exciting story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will Ted and Catherine fall IN LOVE?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PUT the bad guys where they belong - behind bars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 40 EXCITING levels to master and HUNDREDS of quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: relaxed, timed and extreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND hidden treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > WIN achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > GORGEOUS high definition visuals and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step-by-step tutorials for beginners</p></li></ul>",
